WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.824
Summer was almost over.

2
00:00:02.825 --> 00:00:07.365
Soon, Vinnie and Mandy would be starting school.

3
00:00:07.366 --> 00:00:11.152
Right now, they were folding laundry.

4
00:00:11.153 --> 00:00:16.600
"Dad has almost finished moving into the attic," said Vinnie.

5
00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:20.930
"We don’t have a lot of time left for photo trips!"

6
00:00:20.931 --> 00:00:27.823
"And when school starts, we won’t have any time at all," Mandy sighed.

7
00:00:27.824 --> 00:00:30.994
The children looked at each other.

8
00:00:30.995 --> 00:00:34.964
"We shouldn’t waste a single moment," said Vinnie.

9
00:00:34.965 --> 00:00:38.582
He tossed a sock into the laundry basket.

10
00:00:38.583 --> 00:00:44.365
"Mom and Dad are in the kitchen," Mandy said in a low voice.

11
00:00:44.366 --> 00:00:48.140
"Maybe we can sneak upstairs."

12
00:00:48.141 --> 00:00:53.199
"Let’s go," said Vinnie, and they ran up the steps.

13
00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:58.895
Once they were inside the attic, Mandy grabbed the photo album.

14
00:00:58.896 --> 00:01:02.565
"Look, Vinnie!" exclaimed Mandy.

15
00:01:02.566 --> 00:01:05.987
"We’re almost at the end of the album."

16
00:01:05.988 --> 00:01:09.825
She showed him how many pages were left.

17
00:01:09.826 --> 00:01:14.868
"I can’t believe how many trips we’ve done," said Vinnie.

18
00:01:14.869 --> 00:01:17.060
"This is interesting,"

19
00:01:17.061 --> 00:01:20.894
said Mandy, pointing to the new photo.

20
00:01:20.895 --> 00:01:24.872
The old man stood in a boat by a river.

21
00:01:24.873 --> 00:01:27.794
The sun was setting behind him.

22
00:01:27.795 --> 00:01:31.595
Something glowing leaped out of the water.

23
00:01:31.596 --> 00:01:35.295
"Can you tell where this is?" asked Mandy.

24
00:01:35.296 --> 00:01:37.345
Vinnie shook his head.

25
00:01:37.346 --> 00:01:42.362
"Well, we’re about to find out!" Mandy cried.

26
00:01:42.363 --> 00:01:47.719
The picture glowed brighter, and the children’s eyes closed.

27
00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:52.683
Soon they were spinning down the dark tunnel.

28
00:01:52.684 --> 00:01:56.905
Mandy and Vinnie fell onto soft soil.

29
00:01:56.906 --> 00:02:00.406
They could hear shouts and laughter.

30
00:02:00.407 --> 00:02:05.754
"Where are we?" asked Mandy, standing up.

31
00:02:05.755 --> 00:02:08.618
They were in a small village.

32
00:02:08.619 --> 00:02:11.684
People were running around laughing.

33
00:02:11.685 --> 00:02:17.123
Two women hurried over to the children, holding small cups.

34
00:02:17.124 --> 00:02:20.496
They splashed Vinnie with colored water.

35
00:02:20.497 --> 00:02:25.389
"Gross! What is this?" screamed Vinnie.

36
00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:29.051
The front of his shirt was soaked bright red.

37
00:02:29.052 --> 00:02:31.769
He rubbed at the wet stain.

38
00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:34.623
"Everyone is splashing each other,"

39
00:02:34.624 --> 00:02:37.894
Mandy said, looking around.

40
00:02:37.895 --> 00:02:41.772
The street was filled with people holding cups.

41
00:02:41.773 --> 00:02:47.630
Laughing loudly, they chased each other, throwing colored water.

42
00:02:47.631 --> 00:02:51.158
"What’s going on?" asked Vinnie.

43
00:02:51.159 --> 00:02:54.107
A boy splashed Mandy.

44
00:02:54.108 --> 00:02:57.389
"Hey!" cried Mandy.

45
00:02:57.390 --> 00:03:01.617
Her sleeve and part of her arm were stained purple.

46
00:03:01.618 --> 00:03:07.507
The boy set down his cup and put his hands together in front of his chest.

47
00:03:07.508 --> 00:03:11.475
"Hello," he said, bowing slightly.

48
00:03:11.476 --> 00:03:16.737
His face, arms, and clothes were soaked in many bright colors.

49
00:03:16.738 --> 00:03:20.400
The children imitated the boy’s greeting.

50
00:03:20.401 --> 00:03:24.318
Vinnie introduced himself and Mandy.

51
00:03:24.319 --> 00:03:27.612
"I’m Rishi," said the boy.

52
00:03:27.613 --> 00:03:29.914
"Is this your first time here?"

53
00:03:29.915 --> 00:03:32.647
Vinnie and Mandy nodded.

54
00:03:32.648 --> 00:03:36.069
"What’s going on?" asked Vinnie.

55
00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:38.353
"It’s the spring festival!"

56
00:03:38.354 --> 00:03:41.766
shouted Rishi, picking up his cup.

57
00:03:41.767 --> 00:03:44.988
He splashed someone running by.

58
00:03:44.989 --> 00:03:48.823
Everyone was soaked with different colors.

59
00:03:48.824 --> 00:03:52.668
Mandy noticed a cup someone had dropped.

60
00:03:52.669 --> 00:03:54.776
She picked it up.

61
00:03:54.777 --> 00:03:58.485
There was still some colored water inside.

62
00:03:58.486 --> 00:04:04.902
"Oh well, if you can’t beat them, join them," she said.

63
00:04:04.903 --> 00:04:13.866
Mandy laughed and quickly splashed Rishi and her brother.

